{"change_summary":"Added targeted substrate regression coverage so a real zero O2 penetration depth stays distinguishable from the negative uninitialized sentinel, and updated the geometry-scaling harness to use constant per-adult feeding instead of the prior size-dependent feed multiplier. The harness docs/comments now explicitly state that peak-TAN and DO-range comparisons still require a wider 65% band under the current fixed-depth, footprint-scaled habitat model rather than silently claiming 20% concentration parity.","outstanding_risks":["The stocked geometry harness still enforces `CONCENTRATION_PARITY_TOLERANCE = 0.65`; the backlog target of 20% concentration parity for TAN/DO is still not met under the current substrate/habitat normalization.","`CYCLE_TIMELINE_MATURITY_THRESHOLD = 0.04` remains a weak cycling proxy for these stocked runs because the current baselines cross it immediately; tightening that signal is still follow-up work if the project wants a more meaningful cycle-timeline comparison."],"steps":[{"description":"Verified the current substrate implementation already separates zero penetration from the negative uninitialized sentinel, then added focused tests to lock that behavior in place.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Removed the size-dependent feed multiplier from the geometry harness so stocked comparisons use constant per-adult feeding across sizes.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Documented the remaining concentration-parity limitation in the geometry harness and re-ran the focused substrate and harness suites.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all` completed successfully.","`cargo test -p tank_core zero_penetration_depth_remains_a_valid_computed_boundary -- --nocapture` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core negative_penetration_depth_uses_the_uncomputed_sentinel -- --nocapture` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core anoxic_water_yields_zero_penetration_and_positive_suboxic_volume -- --nocapture` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_geometry_scaling -- --nocapture` passed."]}